WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.256 --> 00:00:09.197
Have you seen these seabirds before?

2
00:00:09.958 --> 00:00:11.479
They are emperor penguins.

3
00:00:12.159 --> 00:00:14.020
They look very dressed up, don't they?

4
00:00:15.001 --> 00:00:18.503
These emperor penguins are playing and catching fish in the ocean.

5
00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:21.484
But what do they do when the wind gets colder?

6
00:00:21.504 --> 00:00:25.467
"Brr! Winter must be around the corner!"

7
00:00:26.287 --> 00:00:27.688
says one emperor penguin.

8
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.463
"Yes, it is time to lay our egg," says the other.

9
00:00:32.483 --> 00:00:35.145
"Oh, I can't wait to be a father!"

10
00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:40.749
So the two emperor penguins swim to the frozen shore of Antarctica.

11
00:00:42.089 --> 00:00:43.691
The weather is bitterly cold.

12
00:00:44.491 --> 00:00:46.993
The father finds shelter under an ice cliff.

13
00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.636
Then the mother emperor penguin lays her egg.

14
00:00:51.276 --> 00:00:53.478
"Dear, you did such a good job!

15
00:00:54.298 --> 00:00:55.679
Look at our beautiful egg!

16
00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:59.598
Quick, roll it onto my feet so I can keep it warm."

17
00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:04.101
The father emperor penguin carefully balances the egg on his feet.

18
00:01:04.601 --> 00:01:06.883
He makes sure the egg doesn't touch the ice.

19
00:01:08.064 --> 00:01:12.427
To keep the egg warm, he covers it with the extra skin over his stomach.

20
00:01:12.447 --> 00:01:15.649
"Now head out to sea to eat and rest.

21
00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.952
You worked very hard," says the father.

22
00:01:18.972 --> 00:01:22.934
"I am very tired," says the mother penguin.

23
00:01:22.954 --> 00:01:25.096
"But I can stay on shore.

24
00:01:25.928 --> 00:01:27.989
I want to stay with you and our egg."

25
00:01:28.769 --> 00:01:30.970
But the father emperor penguin insists.

26
00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.571
"No, you go and rest.

27
00:01:34.432 --> 00:01:36.853
I will take care of our egg until you come back."

28
00:01:36.873 --> 00:01:39.454
"Okay, dear, I guess I will.

29
00:01:40.094 --> 00:01:42.855
Please stay warm and keep our egg safe!"

30
00:01:46.336 --> 00:01:49.958
After the mother penguin leaves, it gets colder and colder.

31
00:01:50.718 --> 00:01:54.840
The father emperor penguin and his friends huddle together to keep warm.

32
00:01:55.772 --> 00:01:58.233
They cannot leave their eggs to hunt or fish.

33
00:01:58.974 --> 00:02:01.795
They must sit on their eggs for nine long weeks.

34
00:02:01.815 --> 00:02:06.518
"Brr! Hey, are you guys okay?"

35
00:02:06.538 --> 00:02:09.400
"Brr! Yes, I am doing fine.

36
00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.621
But it is pretty cold, isn't it?"

37
00:02:12.441 --> 00:02:14.803
"Yep! And we have many more weeks to go.

38
00:02:14.823 --> 00:02:18.265
Brr!" "I am getting so hungry!"

39
00:02:18.925 --> 00:02:20.646
thinks the father emperor penguin.

40
00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:24.148
"But it's my job to guard the egg and keep it warm.

41
00:02:25.168 --> 00:02:26.809
I hope it survives the harsh winter."

42
00:02:28.010 --> 00:02:30.111
Finally the egg begins to hatch.

43
00:02:30.131 --> 00:02:31.913
"Cheep, cheep!"

44
00:02:32.653 --> 00:02:36.055
A fuzzy, gray emperor penguin peeps up at its father.

45
00:02:36.075 --> 00:02:38.797
"Look at my beautiful baby!

46
00:02:39.378 --> 00:02:40.538
I am so proud!"

47
00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.062
When the mother returns, she says, "Oh, how wonderful!

48
00:02:46.482 --> 00:02:48.343
Look at my fuzzy little chick!

49
00:02:48.844 --> 00:02:49.724
Thank you, dear.

50
00:02:50.605 --> 00:02:52.606
Now I am strong and rested again.

51
00:02:53.527 --> 00:02:54.888
But look how thin you are.

52
00:02:55.988 --> 00:02:58.350
You have not eaten for over nine weeks.

53
00:02:59.271 --> 00:03:00.312
Let's take turns.

54
00:03:01.153 --> 00:03:03.134
Now I can take care of our baby.

55
00:03:03.895 --> 00:03:05.216
You must eat and rest.

56
00:03:06.137 --> 00:03:08.999
Our baby will need a strong father to protect him."

57
00:03:09.019 --> 00:03:11.221
"You are right.

58
00:03:11.821 --> 00:03:12.802
I will be back soon."

59
00:03:14.023 --> 00:03:16.746
So the father emperor penguin heads to the ocean.

60
00:03:17.546 --> 00:03:21.069
While he is gone, the mother feeds and cares for the chick.

61
00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.012
Soon the father emperor penguin returns.

62
00:03:25.544 --> 00:03:27.045
"Are you strong and rested?"

63
00:03:28.186 --> 00:03:29.887
asks the mother emperor penguin.

64
00:03:30.767 --> 00:03:32.608
"Yes, I feel so much better now.

65
00:03:33.509 --> 00:03:35.670
Look what I brought you both from the ocean!"

66
00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:37.991
"A squid!

67
00:03:38.432 --> 00:03:39.272
My favorite!"

68
00:03:39.292 --> 00:03:40.973
"Cheep, cheep!"

69
00:03:41.513 --> 00:03:42.254
says the baby.

70
00:03:43.014 --> 00:03:44.195
It's his favorite too.

71
00:03:45.336 --> 00:03:47.917
The emperor penguins look so happy together!

72
00:03:48.798 --> 00:03:50.899
Isn't the emperor penguin family great?
